bout_timeline_text'),(170,26,'timeline','3'),(171,26,'_timeline','field_about_timeline'),(172,26,'spec_title','مجالات *التخصص*'),(173,26,'_spec_title','field_about_spec_title'),(174,26,'specialties_0_title','تخدير الحالات الحرجة'),(175,26,'_specialties_0_title','field_about_specialties_title'),(176,26,'specialties_0_text','إدارة المرضى عاليي الخطورة في غرف العمليات والعناية المركزة. (نص تجريبي)'),(177,26,'_specialties_0_text','field_about_specialties_text'),(178,26,'specialties_1_title','جراحات النساء والتوليد'),(179,26,'_specialties_1_title','field_about_specialties_title'),(180,26,'specialties_1_text','تخدير الحوامل وضمان سلامة الأم والجنين. (نص تجريبي)'),(181,26,'_specialties_1_text','field_about_specialties_text'),(182,26,'specialties_2_title','الدعم المتقدم للحياة'),(183,26,'_specialties_2_title','field_about_specialties_title'),(184,26,'specialties_2_text','تقنيات الإقنعة القلبية الرئوية (ECMO) والعناية المتقدمة. (نص تجريبي)'),(185,26,'_specialties_2_text','field_about_specialties_text'),(186,26,'specialties','3'),(187,26,'_specialties','field_about_specialties'),(188,38,'hero_title','الأسئلة الأكثر تكراراً'),(189,38,'_hero_title','field_faq_hero_title'),(190,38,'heading','الأسئلة الشائعة:'),(191,38,'_heading','field_faq_heading'),(192,38,'items_0_q','ما هي أبرز التخصصات الطبية والأكاديمية التي تتميز بها الدكتورة هالة مصطفى جمعة؟'),(193,38,'_items_0_q','field_faq_items_q'),(194,38,'items_0_a','تتمتع الأستاذة الدكتورة هالة مصطفى جمعة بخبرة أكاديمية وسريرية عميقة وممتدة في كلية طب قصر العيني بجامعة القاهرة. وتتخصص بشكل أساسي في تخدير الحالات الحرجة، جراحات النساء والتوليد، وتقنيات الدعم المتقدم للحياة.'),(195,38,'_items_0_a','field_faq_items_a'),(196,38,'items_1_q','هل تقتصر المؤلفات والمقالات المتاحة على التخصصات الأكاديمية الطبية، أم تشمل مجالات أخرى؟'),(197,38,'_items_1_q','field_faq_items_q'),(198,38,'items_1_a','تشمل المؤلفات والمقالات المجالات الطبية الأكاديمية، كما تضم أعمالاً أدبية وفكرية وتاريخية تجمع بين البعد الإنساني للطب والرؤية التاريخية.'),(199,38,'_items_1_a','field_faq_items_a'),(200,38,'items_2_q','كيف يمكن للباحثين وطلاب الطب الاستفادة من المراجع والأبحاث المنشورة في الموقع؟'),(201,38,'_items_2_q','field_faq_items_q'),(202,38,'items_2_a','يمكنكم تصفح قسم الأبحاث العلمية للاطلاع على الملخصات وروابط الأوراق الكاملة، وشراء الكتب المرجعية المتخصصة من المكتبة.'),(203,38,'_items_2_a','field_faq_items_a'),(204,38,'items_3_q','هل تُعقد لقاءات دورية أو ندوات فكرية وثقافية تناقش الإصدارات الجديدة للدكتورة؟'),(205,38,'_items_3_q','field_faq_items_q'),(206,38,'items_3_a','يتم الإعلان عن اللقاءات والندوات عبر النشرة البريدية وصفحات المتابعة؛ اشتركوا في النشرة ليصلكم كل جديد.'),(207,38,'_items_3_a','field_faq_items_a'),(208,38,'items_4_q','ما هي الطريقة المثلى لمتابعة أحدث المقالات التاريخية والطبية فور نشرها؟'),(209,38,'_items_4_q','field_faq_items_q'),(210,38,'items_4_a','الاشتراك في النشرة البريدية ومتابعة الصفحات الرسمية على لينكدإن و ResearchGate هما أفضل وسيلة لمتابعة كل جديد.'),(211,38,'_items_4_a','field_faq_items_a'),(212,38,'items_5_q','كيف يمكنني شراء الكتب، وما هي طرق الدفع المتاحة؟'),(213,38,'_items_5_q','field_faq_items_q'),(214,38,'items_5_a','يمكنكم إضافة الكتب إلى السلة وإتمام الطلب داخل جمهورية مصر العربية، مع خيارين للدفع: الدفع عند الاستلام أو الدفع بالمحفظة الإلكترونية (فودافون كاش / إنستا باي).'),(215,38,'_items_5_a','field_faq_items_a'),(216,38,'items','6'),(217,38,'_items','field_faq_items'),(218,34,'title','نرحب *بالتواصل* معكم'),(219,34,'_title','field_contact_title'),(220,24,'hero_on','1'),(221,24,'_hero_on','field_home_hero_on'),(222,24,'exp_on','1'),(223,24,'_exp_on','field_home_exp_on'),(224,24,'books_on','1'),(225,24,'_books_on','field_home_books_on'),(226,24,'ann_on','1'),(227,24,'_ann_on','field_home_ann_on'),(228,24,'res_on','1'),(229,24,'_res_on','field_home_res_on'),(230,24,'art_on','1'),(231,24,'_art_on','field_home_art_on'),(232,24,'vis_on','1'),(233,24,'_vis_on','field_home_vis_on'),(234,24,'bcta_on','1'),(235,24,'_bcta_on','field_home_bcta_on'),(236,24,'nl_on','1'),(237,24,'_nl_on','field_home_nl_on'),(238,24,'hero_image','50'),(239,24,'_hero_image','field_home_hero_image'),(240,24,'vis_image','51'),(241,24,'_vis_image','field_home_vis_image'),(242,24,'vis_art','52'),(243,24,'_vis_art','field_home_vis_art'),(244,24,'ann_art','53'),(245,24,'_ann_art','field_home_ann_art'),(246,24,'hero_title','Between the precision of *medicine* and the majesty of the word\nA journey in anaesthesia and literary creativity'),(247,24,'_hero_title','field_home_hero_title'),(248,28,'title','A *journey* in anaesthesia and literary creativity'),(249,28,'_title','field_about_title'),(250,28,'intro','Professor of Anaesthesia at Kasr Al Ainy Faculty of Medicine, Cairo University; physician, researcher and author, combining precise clinical care in critically ill patients with scientific enrichment and contemporary literature.'),(251,28,'_intro','field_about_intro'),(252,28,'image','50'),(253,28,'_image','field_about_image'),(254,28,'timeline_title','Career *timeline*'),(255,28,'_timeline_title','field_about_timeline_title'),(256,28,'timeline_0_year','2010'),(257,28,'_timeline_0_year','field_about_timeline_year'),(258,28,'timeline_0_text','Awarded the professorship in anaesthesia and intensive care at Kasr Al Ainy Faculty of Medicine, Cairo University.'),(259,28,'_timeline_0_text','field_about_timeline_text'),(260,28,'timeline_1_year','2000 – 2010'),(261,28,'_timeline_1_year','field_about_timeline_year'),(262,28,'timeline_1_text','Supervision of MSc and MD theses and specialist teaching for postgraduate students. (Placeholder text)'),(263,28,'_timeline_1_text','field_about_timeline_text'),(264,28,'timeline_2_year','1990s'),(265,28,'_timeline_2_year','field_about_timeline_year'),(266,28,'timeline_2_text','The start of the journey between the lecture halls and operating theatres of Kasr Al Ainy. (Placeholder text)'),(267,28,'_timeline_2_text','field_about_timeline_text'),(268,28,'timeline','3'),(269,28,'_timeline','field_about_timeline'),(270,28,'spec_title','Fields of *specialty*'),(271,28,'_spec_title','field_about_spec_title'),(272,28,'specialties_0_title','Critical-care anaesthesia'),(273,28,'_specialties_0_title','field_about_specialties_title'),(274,28,'specialties_0_text','Managing high-risk patients in theatre and intensive care. (Placeholder text)'),(275,28,'_specialties_0_text','field_about_specialties_text'),(276,28,'specialties_1_title','Obstetric surgery'),(277,28,'_specialties_1_title','field_about_specialties_title'),(278,28,'specialties_1_text','Anaesthesia for pregnant women and safeguarding mother and baby. (Placeholder text)'),(279,28,'_specialties_1_text','field_about_specialties_text'),(280,28,'specialties_2_title','Advanced life support'),(281,28,'_specialties_2_title','field_about_specialties_title'),(282,28,'specialties_2_text','ECMO techniques and advanced critical care. (Placeholder text)'),(283,28,'_specialties_2_text','field_about_specialties_text'),(284,28,'specialties','3'),(285,28,'_specialties','field_about_specialties'),(286,40,'hero_title','Frequently asked questions'),(287,40,'_hero_title','field_faq_hero_title'),(288,40,'heading','Frequently asked questions:'),(289,40,'_heading','field_faq_heading'),(290,40,'items_0_q','What are the main medical and academic specialities of Dr. Hala Mostafa Gomaa?'),(291,40,'_items_0_q','field_faq_items_q'),(292,40,'items_0_a','Prof. Dr. Hala Mostafa Gomaa has deep, long-standing academic and clinical experience at Kasr Al Ainy Faculty of Medicine, Cairo University. Her main specialities are critical-care anaesthesia, obstetric surgery and advanced life-support techniques.'),(293,40,'_items_0_a','field_faq_items_a'),(294,40,'items_1_q','Are the books and articles limited to academic medical specialities, or do they cover other fields?'),(295,40,'_items_1_q','field_faq_items_q'),(296,40,'items_1_a','They cover academic medicine and also literary, intellectual and historical works that combine the human side of medicine with a historical outlook.'),(297,40,'_items_1_a','field_faq_items_a'),(298,40,'items_2_q','How can researchers and medical students benefit from the references and research on the site?'),(299,40,'_items_2_q','field_faq_items_q'),(300,40,'items_2_a','Browse the research section for abstracts and links to full papers, and buy the specialist reference books from the library.'),(301,40,'_items_2_a','field_faq_items_a'),(302,40,'items_3_q','Are regular meetings or cultural seminars held to discuss the doctor\'s new releases?'),(303,40,'_items_3_q','field_faq_items_q'),(304,40,'items_3_a','Meetings and seminars are announced through the newsletter and follow pages; subscribe to receive every update.'),(305,40,'_items_3_a','field_faq_items_a'),(306,40,'items_4_q','What is the best way to follow the latest historical and medical articles as soon as they are published?'),(307,40,'_items_4_q','field_faq_items_q'),(308,40,'items_4_a','Subscribing to the newsletter and following the official LinkedIn and ResearchGate pages is the best way to stay up to date.'),(309,40,'_items_4_a','field_faq_items_a'),(310,40,'items_5_q','How can I buy the books, and what payment methods are available?'),(311,40,'_items_5_q','field_faq_items_q'),(312,40,'items_5_a','Add books to your cart and check out within Egypt, with two payment options: cash on delivery or e-wallet payment (Vodafone Cash / InstaPay).'),(313,40,'_items_5_a','field_faq_items_a'),(314,40,'items','6'),(315,40,'_items','field_faq_items'),(316,36,'title','We welcome *hearing* from you'),(317,36,'_title','field_contact_title'),(318,54,'_wp_attached_file','2026/11/book-1.png'),(319,54,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:640;s:6:\"height\";i:720;s:4:\"file\";s:18:\"2026/11/book-1.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:198159;s:5:\"sizes\";a:8:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:18:\"book-1-267x300.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:267;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:45568;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:18:\"book-1-150x150.png\";s:5:\"